{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "clm_soiltemp_discretization",
    "description": "CLM snow/soil heat-conduction discretization: conservative finite-volume variable-coefficient vertical diffusion d/dz(K du/dz) on column_nonuniform_1d, identical to varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules) except that the TOP layer's divergence is integrated over the capr-weighted trapezoid of SoilTemperatureMod.F90:1895 instead of dz[NLEV]: L u[NLEV] = (kdudz_top - G[NLEV]) / M with M = 0.5*(ze[NLEV+1] - zc[NLEV] + capr*(ze[NLEV+1] - zc[NLEV-1])). CLM's Crank-Nicolson top row (SetMatrix_Snow, SoilTemperatureMod.F90:2617-2710) accumulates the diffusive flux on the top layer against the measure dtime/cv * dz[NLEV] / M (the factor `fact` of ComputeHeatDiffFluxAndFactor :1895, capr = 0.34 from clm_varcon), not dz[NLEV], so the divergence that balances cv dT/dt at the top layer is the flux difference divided by M, and a consumer that multiplies the lowered divergence by its per-layer dz (the dumped layer thickness) reproduces the CLM row exactly; the dz[NLEV] in the numerator is the dumped layer thickness, which need not equal the grid spacing ze[NLEV+1]-ze[NLEV] (they differ for the traced column; bugs.md #34). Interior [2, NLEV-1] and bottom rows are the plain stencil of varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc: (G[k+1]-G[k])/dz[k] and (G[2]-kdudz_bot)/dz[1], with the ONE interface flux G[n] = K[n] (u[n]-u[n-1])/(zc[n]-zc[n-1]) of stencils/interface_flux_K_lev. The consumer declares the free names `kdudz_bot`, `kdudz_top`, `ze`, `zc` and `capr` (esm-spec 9.6.8); `zc` is the cell-center field of grids/column_nonuniform_1d/grid.esm. Priority 11: one above varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc (10), so a consumer that imports both rules (this file is a candidate EarthSciDiscretizations PR) deterministically gets the CLM top-row measure. Fires only on the whole compound D( K*D(u, lev), lev ) with u a bare [lev] field and K a bare [lev_nodes] field (esm-spec 9.6.1/9.6.3).",
    "created": "2026-11-08T00:00:00Z",
    "authors": [
      "EqESM project contributors"
    ],
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:varcoeff_laplacian",
      "axes:lev",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:3",
      "bc:prescribed_flux",
      "spec:9.6.8"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Lawrence, D. M., Fisher, R. A., Koven, C. D., Oleson, K. W., Swenson, S. C., Bonan, G., et al. (2019). The Community Land Model Version 5: Description of New Features, Benchmarking, and Impact of Forcing Uncertainty. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(12), 4245-4287.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2018MS001583"
      },
      {
        "citation": "CLM5.0 SoilTemperatureMod.F90: SetMatrix_Snow (top row), ComputeHeatDiffFluxAndFactor (fact with the capr-weighted measure), clm_varcon capr = 0.34.",
        "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CTSM"
      },
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.13 (nonuniform grids)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/stencils/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior.esm" },
    { "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/stencils/interface_flux_K_lev.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc_capr": {
      "params": ["u", "K"],
      "priority": 11,
      "match": {
        "op": "D",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": ["K", { "op": "D", "args": ["u"], "wrt": "lev" }]
          }
        ],
        "wrt": "lev"
      },
      "where": {
        "u": { "shape": ["lev"] },
        "K": { "shape": ["lev_nodes"] }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[2, { "op": "-", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }]],
          [[1, 1]],
          [["NLEV", "NLEV"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior",
            "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K" }
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev",
                    "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K", "n": 2 }
                  },
                  "kdudz_bot"
                ]
              },
              { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 1] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "kdudz_top",
                  {
                    "op": "apply_expression_template",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev",
                    "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K", "n": "NLEV" }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  0.5,
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "index", "args": ["ze", { "op": "+", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }] },
                          { "op": "index", "args": ["zc", "NLEV"] }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          "capr",
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              { "op": "index", "args": ["ze", { "op": "+", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }] },
                              { "op": "index", "args": ["zc", { "op": "-", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }] }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
